WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.966
In this video, we'll help you choose the best budgeting strategy for your Amazon Ads campaigns

00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:09.000
and show you how to set up your budgets in the advertising console.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.160
Before we dive in, remember that Amazon Ads can work with any budget.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.000
Your campaign budget determines how much you will spend on sponsored ads.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.250
Setting a sufficient budget based on your objectives will help you get the most out of your campaign

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.000
over a set period of time.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
There are two types of budgets, daily budget and lifetime budget.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Sponsored products and Sponsored Display Campaigns operate on a daily budget.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Sponsored Brands Campaigns can operate on a daily budget or a lifetime budget.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Let's learn first what a daily budget is and how it works.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.200
Your daily budget is the maximum amount you are willing to spend on average

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.000
each day over a calendar month.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.333
For example, if you set your daily budget to $100,

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:54.333
you may spend up to $3,100 in a 31-day calendar month

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:57.000
for all of the clicks your ads generated.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Setting a daily budget doesn't mean you will spend all of it each day.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
The daily budget gives you flexibility to spend less on days that are low traffic

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
and up to 10% more to take advantage of high traffic days.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.800
How does a daily budget work?

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.000
Let's review the details.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.286
Daily budgets are not rationed throughout the day,

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:18.000
so your budget will be spent as quickly as your ad receives clicks.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
When your daily budget has been spent, your ad will stop serving until the next day.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.947
This means that smaller budgets could be spent in a matter of hours or minutes

00:01:26.947 --> 00:01:28.000
during high traffic periods.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.423
Keep in mind that customers shop at different times,

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:35.000
so it's important to set a daily budget that is high enough to last throughout the day.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.333
If you're not sure how much budget will keep your ad serving,

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.000
test what's right for your business.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.000
You can increase or decrease your daily budget at any time even when your campaign is running.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Now, let's learn what a lifetime budget is and how it works.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Your lifetime budget is the maximum amount that you are willing to spend on a campaign.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
How does a lifetime budget work?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.880
Unlike daily budgets, lifetime budgets take a step back

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:03.000
and look at the maximum investment you'd like to make during the lifetime of your campaign.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.250
If you set an end date for your campaign,

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:09.000
then your lifetime budget will be divided by the number of days in your campaign.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.000
You may spend more or less than this in a given day,

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.000
but the total spend over the course of the campaign will never exceed the lifetime budget.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.000
If you do not set an end date, the campaign will run until the lifetime budget is reached.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.000
It's important to remember that lifetime budgets cannot be decreased once your campaign starts.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.667
Be sure to set the correct lifetime budget before you kick off your campaign

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.000
to ensure you're making the right investment.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.857
Also note that you won't be able to switch between a daily budget and a lifetime budget

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.000
after you've selected one.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.800
To change your budget for an active campaign,

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:46.000
copy your campaign and create a new campaign with the revised budget.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Now that you know the available budget types,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.000
let's walk through how to set them up.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.000
To set up your new campaign budget, go to Campaign Manager and select your campaign type.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.300
If you're setting up a budget for a sponsored brands campaign,

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.000
you'll need to first select daily or lifetime budget

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.000
and then enter the budget amount before selecting Submit for Review.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.667
For sponsored products or sponsored display campaigns,

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:13.000
just enter the Daily Budget Amount in the Settings section before clicking Launch Campaign.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.348
To change an existing campaign's budget,

00:03:15.348 --> 00:03:22.000
go to Settings and make changes such as changing the budget cap for all sponsored products campaigns

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.000
or increasing the average daily budget for any unspent budget.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Alternatively, you can adjust individual campaign budgets directly within the Budgets tab

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.000
in the Campaign Manager.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Find the Budget column and increase or decrease the budget.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.000
Click Save to record your changes.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.000
Finally, remember that there is no universal formula for calculating a good ad budget.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:48.000
The best ad budget is one that fits your business's priorities and long-term goals.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Ready to get started?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.000
Visit ads.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.500
amazon.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.000
com.
